{"id":"vod_bf_19788","vodId":"19788","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"恋爱小行星","name_cn":"恋爱小行星","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/cdd50396a313a06bd33eced5ec13ef00.jpg"},"summary":"木之幡米拉（高柳知叶 配音）曾经和一个男孩许下了“寻找小行星”的约定，随着时间的而流失，虽然米拉和这个男孩早已经没有了任何的联系，但这个约定却依然被铭记在米拉的心间。　　为了完成约定，升上高中的米拉加入了学校的天文社，哪知道为了节省社团经费，天文社竟然于今年同地质社合并，变成了地学社。个性老实，沉默寡言，甚至有些害羞的真中苍（山口爱 配音）、虽然身为学姐，但却异常柔弱的猪濑舞（指出球亚 配音）、常常因为过于认真的性格而被别人误以为在生气的樱井美景（东山奈央 配音）、性格大大咧咧，总是活在自己的世界里的森野真理（上坂堇 配音），对于天空的热爱将这些个性迥异的女孩联结到了一起。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:33:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaixiaoxingxing/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:47.513Z"}